<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Four-part harmony arrangement (Song Yang and Yi Yang)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1949</span><span class="sg-chain-h">arrangement</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">New Songs from the Battlefield, vol. 3</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1974</span><span class="sg-chain-h">recorded on the album</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The Red Sun: Odes to Mao Zedong</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1991</span><span class="sg-chain-h">included in the collection</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Red Song (Tiger Hu)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2009</span><span class="sg-chain-h">cover version</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Internet remixes (AI voices of Donald Trump and SpongeBob SquarePants)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2021</span><span class="sg-chain-h">remixes, internet meme</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired-by"><h2>What it drew on</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Ballad of Picking Tea (Jiangxi folk song, tea-picking opera tradition)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">adapted as</span></li></ul></section>
